# arm: nofiller
# cut contentless sentence-openers at cleanup — "I think" above all
# created 2026-08-13. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/nofiller/.
# bin/arm.sh promote nofiller folds these into profiles/base.env.

CLEANUP_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/directives/cleanup-nofiller.md
